<title>POLAND: Relpol sees 1997 net up to PLN 6 mln.</title>
<headline>Relpol sees 1997 net up to PLN 6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish electromagnetic transmitter producer Relpol SA sees its 1997 net profit rising to six million zlotys from 5.3 million zlotys last year, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
</text>
